05:08.059 --> 05:09.959
Yeah, of course I do. Oh,
great. Well, here you go.

05:10.027 --> 05:12.188
Thank you. Eyes, boom.
Yeah.

05:15.700 --> 05:18.134
Oh!
Oh!

05:18.202 --> 05:20.534
Youse two. We need
to talk to Youse. Huh?

05:20.605 --> 05:22.664
Oh, shit.
