06:29.273 --> 06:31.867
And that's Friday.

06:31.942 --> 06:34.206
Friday.
Okay.

06:34.278 --> 06:37.042
Well, thanks, gentlemen. That's...
That's very... a very clear message.

06:37.114 --> 06:39.412
And we will certainly get
on that right away. Yeah.

06:39.483 --> 06:41.576
Okay. That's
muched appreciated.

06:41.652 --> 06:43.483
Uh, good day to youse.

06:43.554 --> 06:46.284
And good day to youse. Come on.
Huh?

06:46.357 --> 06:48.325
