Chewin' in my ear all the time.

06:48.392 --> 06:49.984
Friday.
Come on. Come on. Come on.

06:50.061 --> 06:51.824
Holy shit!

06:55.232 --> 06:59.293
Guess who sold the drugs
And we can fix the lights now

