07:18.389 --> 07:19.617
Yeah, well, how much
did you get? Perfect.

07:19.690 --> 07:21.089
Oh, dude...
a one, a two...

07:21.158 --> 07:22.785
a $300!
Hello.

07:22.860 --> 07:25.158
