marketplace right now? The NASDAQ!

09:16.307 --> 09:17.740
Dow Jones!
It's up then down.

09:17.808 --> 09:20.538
Stop talking, goddamn
it! Fine! I'll do it!

09:20.611 --> 09:22.408
I'm not getting
